    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1security_1_1_user" kindref="compound">User</ref> Registration Plugin Interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Interface for plugins that provide user registration functionality. Primary implementations: Apache Arrow and WebDAV.</para>
<para>Plugins can integrate with external identity providers and automatically synchronize users into ThemisDB. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
